  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Œuvre du domaine public.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": 49,
    "char_end": 73,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "En lecture libre sur Atramenta.net\n\nLorsque Zarathoustra eut atteint sa trentième année, il quitta sa patrie et le lac de sa patrie et s’en alla dans la montagne.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": null,
    "char_end": null,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Là il jouit de son esprit et de sa solitude et ne s’en lassa point durant dix années.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 284,
    "char_end": 369,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Mais enfin son cœur se transforma, – et un matin, se levant avec l’aurore, il s’avança devant le soleil et lui parla ainsi :\n\n« Ô grand astre !",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": null,
    "char_end": null,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Quel serait ton bonheur, si tu n’avais pas ceux que tu éclaires ?\n\nDepuis dix ans que tu viens vers ma caverne : tu te serais lassé de ta lumière et de ce chemin, sans moi, mon aigle et mon serpent.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": null,
    "char_end": null,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "Mais nous t’attendions chaque matin, nous te prenions ton superflu et nous t’en bénissions.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 714,
    "char_end": 805,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Je suis dégoûté de ma sagesse, comme l’abeille qui a amassé trop de miel.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 815,
    "char_end": 888,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "J’ai besoin de mains qui se tendent.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 889,
    "char_end": 925,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Je voudrais donner et distribuer, jusqu’à ce que les sages parmi les hommes soient redevenus joyeux de leur folie, et les pauvres, heureux de leur richesse.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 926,
    "char_end": 1082,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "Voilà pourquoi je dois descendre dans les profondeurs, comme tu fais le soir quand tu vas derrière les mers, apportant ta clarté au-dessous du monde, ô astre débordant de richesse !",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1084,
    "char_end": 1265,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Je dois disparaître ainsi que toi, me coucher, comme disent les hommes vers qui je veux descendre.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1267,
    "char_end": 1365,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Bénis-moi donc, œil tranquille, qui peux voir sans envie un bonheur même sans mesure !",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1367,
    "char_end": 1453,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "Bénis la coupe qui veut déborder, que l’eau toute dorée en découle, apportant partout le reflet de ta joie !",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1455,
    "char_end": 1563,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "cette coupe veut se vider à nouveau et Zarathoustra veut redevenir homme.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1572,
    "char_end": 1645,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "»\n\nAinsi commença le déclin de Zarathoustra.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": null,
    "char_end": null,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Zarathoustra descendit seul des montagnes, et il ne rencontra personne.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1696,
    "char_end": 1767,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "Mais lorsqu’il arriva dans les bois, soudain se dressa devant lui un vieillard qui avait quitté sa sainte chaumière pour chercher des racines dans la forêt.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1769,
    "char_end": 1925,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "Et ainsi parla le vieillard et il dit à Zarathoustra :\n\n«",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": null,
    "char_end": null,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Il ne m’est pas inconnu, ce voyageur ;",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 1984,
    "char_end": 2022,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "voilà bien des années qu’il passa par ici.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2023,
    "char_end": 2065,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "Il s’appelait Zarathoustra, mais il s’est transformé.\n\nTu portais alors ta cendre à la montagne ;",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": null,
    "part_title": null,
    "section_index": null,
    "section_title": null,
    "block_type": null,
    "char_start": null,
    "char_end": null,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "-tu aujourd’hui porter ton feu dans la vallée ?",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2168,
    "char_end": 2215,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "Ne crains-tu pas le châtiment des incendiaires ?",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2216,
    "char_end": 2264,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Oui, je reconnais Zarathoustra.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2265,
    "char_end": 2296,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Son œil est limpide et sur sa lèvre ne se creuse aucun pli de dégoût.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2297,
    "char_end": 2366,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "Ne s’avance-t-il pas comme un danseur ?",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2367,
    "char_end": 2406,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Zarathoustra s’est transformé, Zarathoustra s’est fait enfant, Zarathoustra s’est éveillé : que vas-tu faire maintenant auprès de ceux qui dorment ?",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2407,
    "char_end": 2555,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "Tu vivais dans la solitude comme dans la mer et la mer te portait.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2556,
    "char_end": 2622,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Malheur à toi, tu veux donc atterrir ?",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2623,
    "char_end": 2661,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "Malheur à toi, tu veux de nouveau traîner toi-même ton corps ?",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
    "part_index": 1,
    "part_title": "PREMIÈRE PARTIE",
    "section_index": 1,
    "section_title": "LE PROLOGUE DE ZARATHOUSTRA",
    "block_type": "section",
    "char_start": 2662,
    "char_end": 2724,
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "»\n\nZarathoustra répondit : « J’aime les hommes.",
    "author": "Friedrich Nietzsche",
    "work": "Ainsi parlait Zarathoustra",
    "source": "Édition Atramenta (pandoc -> txt)",
